# SPA fallback: serve the app shell for client-side routes.
# ORDERING DEPENDENCY: Cloudflare Pages runs Functions (functions/api/* and
# functions/media/*) BEFORE this _redirects rule, so /api/* and /media/* reach their
# Functions and never fall through to index.html. If a Function is renamed or removed,
# its paths would silently start returning index.html (HTTP 200) instead of 404 — keep
# the Functions in place (or add explicit 404 rules) before changing this.
/*    /index.html    200
